       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVIDE-REMAINDER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TOTAL-SECS  PIC 9(6) VALUE 98765.
       01 HOURS       PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 MINS        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01 SECS        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01 REST        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DIVIDE TOTAL-SECS BY 3600 GIVING HOURS REMAINDER REST
           DIVIDE REST BY 60 GIVING MINS REMAINDER SECS
           DISPLAY TOTAL-SECS " SECONDS = "
                   HOURS "H " MINS "M " SECS "S"
           STOP RUN.
